00:33:03.760 --> 00:33:14.740
<v Hillary Frank>Rachel is  the quintessential theater kid. She describes herself as liberal and bisexual. She's never had sex with anyone, but she keeps a good luck condom in her drawer, just in case.
<v Hillary Frank>瑞秋是典型的戏剧社孩子。她自称是自由派和双性恋者。她从未与任何人发生过性关系，但她在抽屉里放着一个护身避孕套，以防万一。

